<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Taxpayer Identification Number Request</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif; /* System font stack */
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3 { font-family: "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans", Arial, sans-serif; } /* System font stack for headings */
  .section-header { font-weight: bold; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .form-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 15px; }
  .form-label { flex-basis: 30%; }
  .form-input { flex-basis: 65%; border-bottom: 1px solid #000; }
  .signature-line { border-bottom: 1px solid #000; width: 100%; margin-top: 50px; }
  .two-column-section { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 20px; }
  .two-column-section > div { width: 48%; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">
  <header style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <div style="font-size: 30px; font-weight: bold;">NH</div>
    <div>
      <h1 style="font-size: 24px; margin: 0;">University of New Hampshire</h1>
    </div>
  </header>

  <h2 style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px;">Request for Student's Taxpayer Identification Number</h2>
  <p style="text-align: center; font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 50px;">(Substitute Form W-9S)</p>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 40px;">
    <p>Return completed signed form, in person or by mail, to:</p>
    <p><span data-field="department_name">{{ department_name }}</span></p>
    <p>ATTN: <span data-field="attn_name">{{ attn_name }}</span></p>
    <p><span data-field="street_address_1">{{ street_address_1 }}</span></p>
    <p><span data-field="street_address_2">{{ street_address_2 }}</span></p>
    <p><span data-field="city_state_zip">{{ city_state_zip }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 50px;">
    <div style="width: 50%;">
      <div class="section-header">Do not submit this form to the IRS.</div>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 45%;">
      <!-- Placeholder for visual balance -->
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="border: 1px solid #000; padding: 20px;">
    <div class="form-row">
      <div class="form-label">Legal Name of Student:</div>
      <div class="form-input"><span data-field="full_name">{{ full_name }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <div class="form-label">Permanent Address:</div>
      <div class="form-input"><span data-field="address">{{ address }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <div class="form-label">UNH ID:</div>
      <div class="form-input"><span data-field="unh_id">{{ unh_id }}</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 50px;">
    <h3 style="font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 15px;">PART I</h3>
    <div style="border: 1px solid #000; padding: 20px;">
      <div class="form-row">
        <div class="form-label">Taxpayer Identification Number</div>
        <div class="form-input" style="width: 65%;">
          <span data-field="ssn_itin_placeholder">{{ ssn_itin_placeholder }}</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="form-row" style="margin-top: 30px;">
        <div class="form-label">UNH Federal Tax ID:</div>
        <div class="form-input"><span data-field="unh_federal_tax_id">{{ unh_federal_tax_id }}</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 50px;">
    <h3 style="font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 15px;">PART II</h3>
    <p>I certify that the number shown on this form is my correct taxpayer identification number.</p>
    <div class="two-column-section">
      <div>
        <div class="form-label" style="margin-bottom: 5px;">Signature</div>
        <div class="signature-line" data-field="signature">{{ signature }}</div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="form-label" style="margin-bottom: 5px;">Date</div>
        <div class="signature-line" data-field="date">{{ date }}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 50px;">
    <h3 style="font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 15px;">OR</h3>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <h3 style="font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 15px;">PART III</h3>
    <div style="border: 1px solid #000; padding: 20px;">
      <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
        <input type="checkbox" style="margin-right: 10px;">
        I am a foreign national/nonresident alien and do not have a Social Security Number or Individual Taxpayer Identification Number. I do not plan to file an income tax return in the U.S.
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
        <input type="checkbox" style="margin-right: 10px;">
        I do not wish to provide my taxpayer identification number to UNH at this time. I understand that I may be subject to an IRS fine of $50 for failure to do so. I further understand that the IRS will not be able to use the Form 1098-T filed by UNH to confirm my eligibility for certain education tax benefits without my taxpayer identification number.
      </div>
      <div class="two-column-section">
        <div>
          <div class="form-label" style="margin-bottom: 5px;">Signature</div>
          <div class="signature-line" data-field="signature_2">{{ signature_2 }}</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="form-label" style="margin-bottom: 5px;">Date</div>
          <div class="signature-line" data-field="date_2">{{ date_2 }}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <footer style="margin-top: 100px; font-size: 12px; text-align: center;">
    See instructions on back
  </footer>
</div>
</body>
</html>